# backlog-receipt-traced-removal's validator starts (BL-879 grammar), lead ruling (a), batch 256. Every distinct state
# is ONE start of a copy of scripts/validate-backlog-receipts.sh, tagged at its start through env FXCELL=<cell> by
# run.sh's cli(); run.sh asserts that the tagged starts are exactly the cli cells below, each once. The validator's own
# worker re-starts under a tagged start are covered by the ONE nested row at the end. The in-process passes that remain
# (fx_inproc: the probe-world build, r13_untraced, vbr_sec_setup alone) reach no worker start.
